{
 "title": "Cmd-N on a busy Mac (user 2026-11-10: \"cmd n is lowkey hella slow\"): the New Tab pool as after one spare took over a second (spare dropped, WebKit's setup marked slow: debug.new_tab drop_spare slow), 65 s later, then Cmd-N and window snapshots at about 0.1 s, 0.3 s and 1 s, light then dark. Before the fix the pool stays empty and the page loads cold after the key; after it the gate asked again and the page is prewarmed. Record with: cmux-ci capture SHA --state scripts/cmux-next/media/states/cmd-n-slow-webkit.json --mac (any commit with debug.new_tab drop_spare slow).",
 "launch_args": [
  "--showcase"
 ],
 "steps": [
  {
   "title": "Launch",
   "wait": 3,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "A fixed window size, so every capture frames the page the same",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.window_frame",
    "params": {
     "frame": [
      160,
      85,
      1280,
      820
     ]
    }
   },
   "wait": 0.3,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "light: appearance",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.appearance",
    "params": {
     "mode": "light"
    }
   },
   "wait": 1,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "light: as after one New Tab spare took over a second on a loaded Mac (spare dropped, WebKit's setup marked slow), then 65 s: the fixed gate asks again (30 s, 60 s for a second mark) and the pool warms; before the fix it stays slow",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.new_tab",
    "params": {
     "action": "drop_spare",
     "slow": true
    }
   },
   "wait": 65,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "light: the pool before Cmd-N",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.new_tab",
    "params": {
     "action": "state"
    }
   },
   "record": true,
   "wait": 0.2,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "light: Cmd-N",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.key",
    "params": {
     "key": "n",
     "modifiers": [
      "command"
     ]
    }
   },
   "wait": 0.05,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "light: the window about 0.1s after Cmd-N",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.window_snapshot",
    "params": {
     "kind": "main",
     "path": "{collect}"
    }
   },
   "collect": "light-01s.png",
   "wait": 0.15,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "light: the window about 0.3s after Cmd-N",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.window_snapshot",
    "params": {
     "kind": "main",
     "path": "{collect}"
    }
   },
   "collect": "light-03s.png",
   "wait": 0.6,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "light: the window about 1s after Cmd-N",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.window_snapshot",
    "params": {
     "kind": "main",
     "path": "{collect}"
    }
   },
   "collect": "light-1s.png",
   "wait": 1.5,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "light: the page",
   "wait": 0.1,
   "shot": true
  },
  {
   "title": "dark: appearance",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.appearance",
    "params": {
     "mode": "dark"
    }
   },
   "wait": 1,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "dark: as after one New Tab spare took over a second on a loaded Mac (spare dropped, WebKit's setup marked slow), then 65 s: the fixed gate asks again (30 s, 60 s for a second mark) and the pool warms; before the fix it stays slow",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.new_tab",
    "params": {
     "action": "drop_spare",
     "slow": true
    }
   },
   "wait": 65,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "dark: the pool before Cmd-N",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.new_tab",
    "params": {
     "action": "state"
    }
   },
   "record": true,
   "wait": 0.2,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "dark: Cmd-N",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.key",
    "params": {
     "key": "n",
     "modifiers": [
      "command"
     ]
    }
   },
   "wait": 0.05,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "dark: the window about 0.1s after Cmd-N",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.window_snapshot",
    "params": {
     "kind": "main",
     "path": "{collect}"
    }
   },
   "collect": "dark-01s.png",
   "wait": 0.15,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "dark: the window about 0.3s after Cmd-N",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.window_snapshot",
    "params": {
     "kind": "main",
     "path": "{collect}"
    }
   },
   "collect": "dark-03s.png",
   "wait": 0.6,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "dark: the window about 1s after Cmd-N",
   "rpc": {
    "method": "debug.window_snapshot",
    "params": {
     "kind": "main",
     "path": "{collect}"
    }
   },
   "collect": "dark-1s.png",
   "wait": 1.5,
   "shot": false
  },
  {
   "title": "dark: the page",
   "wait": 0.1,
   "shot": true
  }
 ]
}
